        "content": "<p>As children, we believed that the smallest things could make an ordinary day feel special — a new notebook, a cute pen, a sticker sheet we never wanted to use because it was simply too pretty.</p><p>Years later, as <strong>mothers ourselves</strong>, we wanted our children to feel that same little joy in everyday moments.</p><h3>So, in 2024, we decided to create one.</h3><p>Founded by sisters <strong>Smita Bara</strong> and <strong>Sweta Kindo</strong>, CocoPoco started with one simple mission: to help you romanticize your everyday.</p><p>Today, CocoPoco brings together kawaii stationery, aesthetic gifts, and cute everyday essentials.</p><p>Because life doesn’t need a special occasion to feel special.</p><h3>So why not “Romanticize your Everyday”</h3>",
